WEBVTT

00:37.871 --> 00:42.000
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

01:13.198 --> 01:15.950
I was a special child.

01:57.033 --> 01:58.535
It is fine to kill.

01:59.619 --> 02:03.039
But you should not be caught.

02:03.957 --> 02:05.208
Why is that?

02:11.589 --> 02:13.925
A good son always answers "yes."

02:15.135 --> 02:19.222
To talk back and ask "why" is bad manners.

02:20.348 --> 02:21.432
Seung-jo.

02:24.602 --> 02:25.520
Yes,

02:26.229 --> 02:27.147
Mother.

02:38.199 --> 02:40.160
I just wanted Mother's approval.

03:00.471 --> 03:01.973
I wanted to be comforted.

03:04.350 --> 03:06.227
Just once would've been enough.

03:25.121 --> 03:28.958
Although we can't determine
why only he can partially transform,

03:29.751 --> 03:31.878
we can formulate a hypothesis.

03:32.962 --> 03:34.130
What would that be?

03:35.673 --> 03:38.343
Unlike other specimens,

03:39.469 --> 03:42.931
Seung-jo inherited his Najin
from his biological mother.

03:45.016 --> 03:47.936
Akiko, you mean?

03:48.561 --> 03:53.983
Having already learned much
from the mother's body,

03:54.776 --> 03:57.028
the Najin, we can assume,

03:57.111 --> 04:01.866
has conformed more actively
as it entered the child.

04:04.744 --> 04:05.578
Like Seishin…

04:08.498 --> 04:10.124
who suddenly activated her body

04:11.125 --> 04:15.838
in order to protect her daughter.

04:18.675 --> 04:20.385
Does this mean that

04:21.970 --> 04:26.599
Akiko's maternal instinct
exists in that boy's head?

04:28.685 --> 04:29.894
Perhaps.

04:32.188 --> 04:33.773
Interesting.

04:43.574 --> 04:44.742
That's when I realized

04:46.202 --> 04:48.079
that I wasn't a special person,

04:49.580 --> 04:50.581
but a special…

04:52.292 --> 04:53.584
specimen.

04:56.296 --> 04:59.132
Did your meeting with Mr. Jang go well?

05:00.091 --> 05:00.967
Yes.

05:02.510 --> 05:03.594
It went well.

05:03.678 --> 05:08.266
I expect good results
from the next plan as well.

05:09.350 --> 05:10.351
Seung-jo.

07:19.105 --> 07:20.189
Did you get some sleep?

07:24.485 --> 07:25.403
How's your injury?

07:30.825 --> 07:33.661
What's wrong? Does it still hurt a lot?

07:35.329 --> 07:36.789
If this is a dream…

07:40.710 --> 07:42.378
I don't want to wake up.

08:08.237 --> 08:09.405
"I missed you."

08:13.367 --> 08:18.623
Saying these words over and over
didn't lessen my longing for you.

08:21.000 --> 08:22.543
I missed you so much.

08:49.028 --> 08:51.155
What happened? Where's No. 71?

08:51.822 --> 08:53.074
We haven't found him yet.

09:01.332 --> 09:02.458
It was you, wasn't it?

09:06.295 --> 09:07.964
What the hell did you do?

09:12.051 --> 09:13.219
For freedom.

09:14.804 --> 09:18.975
Don't kid yourself. That's not freedom.
That's confusion and chaos.

09:19.892 --> 09:21.102
Whatever it may be…

09:23.938 --> 09:26.190
it sure is more fun
than what you have in mind.

09:26.983 --> 09:28.234
What are you talking about?

09:28.985 --> 09:30.069
I know…

09:33.698 --> 09:35.366
what it is you want to do.

09:58.097 --> 09:59.599
Hungry.

10:29.378 --> 10:32.965
Man, that guy's plastered.
He must've drank all night.

10:36.218 --> 10:37.136
Excuse me, sir.

10:37.970 --> 10:38.971
Hungry.

10:48.481 --> 10:49.815
Something's come up.

11:06.457 --> 11:10.378
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN LIFE AND DEATH

11:10.461 --> 11:14.382
EPISODE 6
BAIT

11:25.017 --> 11:27.687
Was it you who put Master Jang
on the wanted list?

11:27.770 --> 11:30.272
Well, I wouldn't say that--

11:30.356 --> 11:34.026
I heard you were in charge of the case.
That means it was you.

11:34.110 --> 11:37.279
What was I supposed to do?
People are getting murdered.

11:37.363 --> 11:40.866
Jang Ho-jae was leaving evidence
all over the crime scenes.

11:40.950 --> 11:42.993
Your family has long been indebted

11:43.077 --> 11:46.038
to the master
of the House of Golden Treasure.

11:46.122 --> 11:49.417
How dare you make Master Jang
a wanted man?

11:51.544 --> 11:55.047
Don't bother finding justice
by going after the wrong person.

11:57.633 --> 11:59.218
Look for Jong-hyeok instead.

12:00.094 --> 12:00.928
What?

12:01.762 --> 12:05.015
My boy has gone missing.

12:05.725 --> 12:06.767
What do you mean?

12:06.851 --> 12:10.020
He went to his company's training camp,

12:10.104 --> 12:14.275
but then he sent me ten million won
and stopped answering his phone.

12:15.526 --> 12:19.488
So I called his workplace,
and they said there was no such training.

12:20.072 --> 12:21.323
Which company is it?

12:22.074 --> 12:23.576
Jeonseung Biotech.

12:23.659 --> 12:26.662
SEONG JUN-MO (41 YEARS OLD)
RESEARCHER AT JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

12:26.746 --> 12:30.040
OH KI-HOON (29 YEARS OLD)
BODYGUARD AT JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

12:30.124 --> 12:34.295
AHN JONG-HYEOK
HIRED A MONTH AGO BY JEONSEUNG BIOTECH

12:39.091 --> 12:40.926
So this all comes down to…

12:42.887 --> 12:44.346
Jeonseung Biotech.

12:45.014 --> 12:46.098
Should I dig into it?

12:46.182 --> 12:47.683
Hey, you scared me.

12:48.225 --> 12:49.810
Let a person know you're there.

12:49.894 --> 12:53.105
Did you meet up
with the grandma from yesterday?

12:59.153 --> 13:02.990
How do you two know each other?
She seemed pretty close to Jang Ho-jae.

13:03.073 --> 13:04.408
Detective Park, let's eat.

13:04.909 --> 13:07.578
- Should I order gukbap?
- What are you having?

13:07.661 --> 13:10.581
To be honest,
I found it weird from the beginning.

13:11.290 --> 13:14.084
Sure, Jang Ho-jae
may be competent and all that,

13:14.168 --> 13:17.755
but you ordered him to find leads
like it was no big deal.

13:17.838 --> 13:20.674
You also told me to keep an eye on him,

13:20.758 --> 13:23.928
and you stayed up all night at the ICU,
watching over Mr. Kwon.

13:24.011 --> 13:24.929
Aren't you hungry?

13:25.012 --> 13:27.223
You've known each other
for a long time, right?

13:27.306 --> 13:28.516
You can order later, then.

13:33.187 --> 13:35.564
This is Yuh Myung-jun of Team 2,
Violent Crimes.

13:36.982 --> 13:38.150
What?

13:40.694 --> 13:41.529
Captain?

13:44.448 --> 13:47.785
An indiscriminate killing occurred
on a subway platform in Seoul.

13:47.868 --> 13:53.249
Three civilians died at the scene,
and one was rushed to the emergency room.

13:53.874 --> 13:57.419
At 5:00 a.m., a call was received about
a man who appeared to be hallucinating…

14:05.135 --> 14:07.555
According to the police, Suspect A…

14:07.638 --> 14:08.472
Jong…

14:08.556 --> 14:12.643
…attacked B, a male in his 50s,
who had been preparing for operations…

14:12.726 --> 14:13.727
I know that kid.

14:16.105 --> 14:18.315
He was getting tested on
below Jeonseung Biotech.

14:19.733 --> 14:20.568
Is that true?

14:20.651 --> 14:23.571
Yeah. He escaped from there this morning.

14:26.365 --> 14:27.199
I did it.

14:29.493 --> 14:31.078
I set him free.

14:33.330 --> 14:35.124
Why in the world would you do that?

14:37.793 --> 14:38.627
To show them.

14:41.380 --> 14:45.134
People these days only believe things
they see with their own eyes.

14:46.594 --> 14:47.845
Their faith is now weak.

14:47.928 --> 14:49.930
Three more people died because of you.

14:50.014 --> 14:52.182
And even more may end up dead.

14:53.267 --> 14:54.268
Got that?

14:55.269 --> 14:56.270
What do you mean?

14:58.022 --> 15:00.441
More people may die?
Explain what that means.

15:02.401 --> 15:03.819
I don't know the details.

15:05.571 --> 15:07.031
All I know is that Lady Maeda

15:08.699 --> 15:11.035
is planning something dangerous.

15:11.118 --> 15:13.704
ASSAILANT ATTACKS
STATION EMPLOYEE INDISCRIMINATELY

15:14.204 --> 15:16.248
CHAOS STRIKES MORNING COMMUTE
6 VICTIMS

15:16.332 --> 15:17.207
How dangerous?

15:18.417 --> 15:20.252
You know her better than I do.

15:21.045 --> 15:22.713
She'll see it through to the end.

15:24.673 --> 15:25.507
Probably.

15:26.717 --> 15:28.802
Is this situation part of that plan?

15:30.596 --> 15:34.266
Are you using him as bait
to capture both of us?

15:35.434 --> 15:37.019
I suppose you really don't like me.

15:37.102 --> 15:38.270
I don't trust you yet.

15:38.354 --> 15:40.564
Who got you out of the underground again?

15:40.648 --> 15:43.484
I clearly remember
who stabbed and kidnapped me.

16:09.677 --> 16:13.847
Good God, he sent ten men flying
when we tried to grapple him down.

16:13.931 --> 16:15.182
He's like a bull.

16:15.265 --> 16:18.602
So I had no choice
but to zap him down with a Taser.

16:18.686 --> 16:20.145
Only then did he drop down.

16:21.480 --> 16:24.817
What kind of monster could do that?

16:25.734 --> 16:26.568
Jong-hyeok.

16:30.280 --> 16:32.199
Look at me. Ahn Jong-hyeok.

16:33.659 --> 16:35.119
What's wrong with you?

16:37.454 --> 16:38.414
Captain!

16:39.581 --> 16:40.749
Are you okay, sir?

16:41.834 --> 16:44.503
I'll go and get the first aid kit.

16:45.087 --> 16:46.255
Do you know him?

16:50.926 --> 16:52.094
BUGANG COMPANY

16:55.556 --> 16:56.473
Hello?

16:57.599 --> 16:58.767
It's me, Captain Yuh.

16:59.560 --> 17:01.603
Hey! What happened to you?

17:02.229 --> 17:04.398
I'm still alive. Don't worry.

17:04.481 --> 17:06.692
Are you using this number again?

17:06.775 --> 17:07.860
Yeah.

17:09.278 --> 17:10.237
I'm back.

17:14.116 --> 17:14.950
Okay.

17:15.576 --> 17:17.244
Can you fill me in?

17:18.787 --> 17:21.373
It's Jong-hyeok.
Sinseol-dong Antenna's grandson.

17:22.124 --> 17:23.375
He was the culprit.

17:25.252 --> 17:27.171
And he was recently hired by…

17:27.254 --> 17:28.088
Yes.

17:28.922 --> 17:30.007
Jeonseung Biotech.

17:35.679 --> 17:37.639
What the hell are you doing?

17:37.723 --> 17:39.808
You can't even manage
a single specimen right.

17:39.892 --> 17:43.020
Do you see how your mess
is all over the news?!

17:48.692 --> 17:50.527
I think it was Seung-jo, sir.

17:50.611 --> 17:52.613
Why would he do that?

17:54.239 --> 17:56.492
Shouldn't you be asking
Lady Maeda instead?

17:57.076 --> 18:00.037
Are you saying
that Lady Maeda planned all this?

18:08.212 --> 18:10.881
That's why I warned you, man.

18:17.262 --> 18:19.431
I told you I didn't like this plan

18:19.515 --> 18:22.768
from the moment she made
Jang Tae-sang come back, didn't I?

18:24.770 --> 18:28.440
I don't know what she was thinking
when she gave that order,

18:28.524 --> 18:32.027
but can't you see that it put all of us
at Jeonseung Biotech in danger?

18:37.116 --> 18:40.452
As you said, the previous chairman
planted the Najin in my head

18:40.536 --> 18:41.995
so I could protect Jeonseung

18:42.079 --> 18:45.374
and devote myself
to making great accomplishments.

18:50.212 --> 18:53.882
Should the welfare of Jeonseung
be threatened by this ordeal,

18:55.217 --> 18:58.387
I'll let nothing stop me
from eliminating every risk,

18:58.470 --> 19:01.306
whether it be Jang Tae-sang,
your incompetence…

19:04.184 --> 19:06.061
or Lady Maeda's peremptory decisions.

19:11.900 --> 19:13.318
Don't forget that.

19:13.902 --> 19:14.820
First,

19:15.737 --> 19:17.281
take care of this mess.

19:18.490 --> 19:20.617
Bring No. 71 back.

19:21.243 --> 19:24.663
Then we can talk with Lady Maeda again.

19:25.330 --> 19:26.165
Satisfied?

20:15.047 --> 20:16.340
What are you doing?

20:18.217 --> 20:19.718
Are you planning on going alone?

20:21.136 --> 20:22.221
I am going alone.

20:23.472 --> 20:26.892
You're not going anywhere,
not when you haven't even recovered.

20:33.023 --> 20:33.899
See?

20:35.400 --> 20:37.110
I can go with you, can't I?

20:38.195 --> 20:39.696
- Still no.
- Master Jang.

20:39.780 --> 20:41.198
From now on,

20:42.157 --> 20:44.243
I don't want to see you get hurt.

20:46.536 --> 20:49.373
I don't want to see you fall into danger,

20:49.456 --> 20:52.292
nor do I want to go on to regret
leading you into danger.

20:53.377 --> 20:54.294
Not anymore.

20:55.170 --> 20:56.713
This is the 21st century.

20:57.923 --> 21:02.261
Don't tell me you're trying to protect me
because that sounds so outdated.

21:03.095 --> 21:04.096
I am.

21:05.555 --> 21:09.226
I may not look it,
but I'm over 100 years old.

21:09.309 --> 21:12.646
And my way of thinking
is quite old-fashioned as well,

21:12.729 --> 21:15.899
so I still believe
that men should protect women.

21:17.526 --> 21:19.945
But I think I'm a better fighter than you.

21:21.571 --> 21:22.739
Still no.

21:22.823 --> 21:23.740
And…

21:27.369 --> 21:28.370
I don't die.

21:30.914 --> 21:31.832
I don't

21:33.041 --> 21:35.877
want to be a woman
who needs to be protected by you.

21:38.171 --> 21:40.590
I want to be a woman
who stays by your side.

21:43.427 --> 21:44.636
So,

21:46.513 --> 21:48.682
let's stay together, Master Jang.

21:51.977 --> 21:52.853
Yeah?

22:07.242 --> 22:09.119
It's cheating if you smile like that.

22:15.250 --> 22:16.543
Give me one more smile.

22:39.775 --> 22:40.859
Yeah.

22:43.278 --> 22:44.696
Who? From where?

22:45.197 --> 22:47.783
Jeonseung Biotech.
That's where they're from.

22:56.124 --> 22:58.293
Are you insane? You're going where?

22:58.377 --> 22:59.211
To that kid.

22:59.294 --> 23:01.213
Why the heck would you do that?

23:03.173 --> 23:04.049
I know him.

23:04.132 --> 23:05.133
So what?

23:06.009 --> 23:08.011
He got arrested. What can you do?

23:08.595 --> 23:10.806
Jeonseung won't let him be.

23:12.057 --> 23:14.935
They'll move to deal with him
in one of two ways.

23:15.018 --> 23:16.812
Either take him back or kill him.

23:17.687 --> 23:20.190
I should do something
before that happens.

23:20.273 --> 23:23.860
Aren't you sick of it?
Living your whole life like that?

23:25.737 --> 23:29.074
You fought them, got beaten up,
and barely managed to escape alive.

23:29.741 --> 23:31.743
And you still want to fight them?

23:32.661 --> 23:34.663
How can you be like that?

23:34.746 --> 23:36.415
It's about time you call it quits!

23:37.374 --> 23:39.543
- Seung-jo.
- Just run away instead!

23:40.043 --> 23:44.047
Go wherever you want with that woman
and live your life now, okay?

23:46.675 --> 23:48.301
I want to live my life too.

23:49.344 --> 23:50.887
Happily, with her.

23:50.971 --> 23:51.888
But

23:53.014 --> 23:54.433
not by running away.

23:56.017 --> 23:58.478
There is no life of mine that I can find…

24:01.064 --> 24:02.149
by running away.

24:09.906 --> 24:10.824
Who is it?

24:10.907 --> 24:11.992
It's Noh Ji-su.

24:13.076 --> 24:15.662
Some men from Jeonseung Biotech are here.

24:16.538 --> 24:17.956
They want to take the culprit.

24:20.750 --> 24:22.043
What are you saying?

24:22.127 --> 24:25.088
You barge in here and demand
we hand over the culprit?

24:25.172 --> 24:27.924
- That person is infected.
- Infected?

24:28.008 --> 24:29.551
I was informed that

24:30.677 --> 24:33.847
your team asked Jeonseung Biotech
about this nitrogen gas.

24:33.930 --> 24:37.350
We did.
And we haven't heard back from you.

24:37.434 --> 24:41.021
This is a portable nitrogen gas canister
used to suppress violent patients.

24:41.855 --> 24:43.482
We developed it.

24:44.065 --> 24:46.860
The infected patients display
strong aggression, you see.

24:47.944 --> 24:50.280
Here are the official notes from the KDCA

24:51.031 --> 24:53.700
and the approval letter
from the National Police Agency.

24:54.493 --> 24:56.578
Please transfer the patient over to us.

24:56.661 --> 24:58.580
You think we're a joke, huh?

24:59.956 --> 25:03.376
He's accused of being involved in six
murder cases in the last two months.

25:03.460 --> 25:06.963
Even today, three people died
in a single location.

25:07.047 --> 25:09.633
Do you really think this stupid paper

25:09.716 --> 25:12.469
can convince me
to hand over such a violent criminal?

25:23.730 --> 25:28.568
The safety of civilians must come
before the investigations right now.

25:28.652 --> 25:31.863
If the disease spreads
and things spin out of control,

25:31.947 --> 25:34.491
will you, Captain Yuh,
take responsibility for it?

25:41.081 --> 25:43.917
- They're moving faster than I thought.
- Aren't you too late?

25:44.000 --> 25:46.753
The precinct is ten minutes away.
We still have time.

25:46.836 --> 25:49.798
So what if you have time?
What are you going to do there?

25:50.382 --> 25:51.508
What I do best.

25:52.592 --> 25:53.426
Shake things up.

25:56.304 --> 25:58.306
I'm ready. Let's go.

26:00.016 --> 26:00.850
Me too.

26:04.437 --> 26:05.689
I'm coming with you.

26:25.125 --> 26:28.128
Aren't you going a bit too fast?
Can't you see the sign?

26:28.211 --> 26:31.089
I can. But I've never really kept to them.

26:37.887 --> 26:40.056
- Did you check?
- Yes.

26:40.140 --> 26:43.101
The KDCA confirmed everything he said.

26:43.184 --> 26:45.604
There are a handful
of infected people nationwide

26:45.687 --> 26:47.814
who have displayed similar symptoms.

26:48.398 --> 26:51.651
The issue is highly sensitive,
so everything's strictly confidential.

26:51.735 --> 26:55.822
I also confirmed that Jeonseung Biotech
is researching the causes of infection.

26:55.905 --> 26:58.199
Wait. Captain?

26:58.283 --> 27:00.327
They're covering the cameras.

27:02.287 --> 27:03.538
Damn it.

27:08.168 --> 27:09.628
Should I release the gas first?

27:09.711 --> 27:11.630
Don't bother. Just open it.

29:19.591 --> 29:20.884
CAPTAIN YUH MYUNG-JUN

29:20.967 --> 29:22.218
Yes, Captain.

29:22.302 --> 29:23.553
Hey. Where are you?

29:25.513 --> 29:27.265
Hey! Where are you?

29:27.932 --> 29:30.018
I'm tailing the Jeonseung Biotech people.

29:31.519 --> 29:33.104
- What?
- I'm sorry.

29:33.188 --> 29:37.150
I know the culprit was caught red-handed.
I know this case is now closed.

29:37.650 --> 29:39.235
But something doesn't feel right.

29:39.319 --> 29:41.654
You don't think I'm reliable, I know.

29:41.738 --> 29:44.449
But this time, I'll trust my instincts
and follow through.

29:44.532 --> 29:45.450
I'm sorry, sir.

29:47.535 --> 29:49.287
Finally, you're doing some work.

29:50.163 --> 29:51.915
Do not lose them.

29:52.415 --> 29:54.375
And keep me updated.

29:55.210 --> 29:57.378
Yes, sir. I won't come back empty-handed.

29:57.462 --> 29:58.963
Good. That's all.

30:21.277 --> 30:24.572
My grandson. I heard he was here.

30:25.281 --> 30:27.700
You can let me see him, can't you?

30:29.285 --> 30:32.247
Yes, but not right now.

30:33.706 --> 30:38.127
No. My baby didn't do it.
Jong-hyeok would never do such a thing!

30:38.753 --> 30:40.421
You know that, don't you?

30:40.505 --> 30:41.965
Yes, well…

30:54.352 --> 30:56.646
There are two cars
and a motorcycle tailing us.

30:57.605 --> 30:58.439
Floor it.

31:37.061 --> 31:37.937
Do you…

31:40.023 --> 31:40.857
like him a lot?

31:45.570 --> 31:47.655
Why do I have to tell you that?

31:48.531 --> 31:49.782
Because I like him too.

31:52.493 --> 31:54.996
I knew about the bad blood
between him and Lady Maeda.

31:56.831 --> 31:57.749
And I knew

31:59.125 --> 32:01.377
why Jeonseung Biotech made him so angry.

32:03.546 --> 32:07.592
So when he said he was going to wipe out
the underground lab a year ago…

32:10.720 --> 32:12.305
I didn't hesitate for a second…

32:14.432 --> 32:16.100
and told him I'd be on his side.

32:20.021 --> 32:21.022
At the time…

32:24.609 --> 32:27.070
I really thought I would die for him.

32:29.739 --> 32:30.740
But…

32:36.162 --> 32:37.163
I was wrong.

32:40.166 --> 32:41.626
On that day, one year ago…

32:46.172 --> 32:47.924
no one stopped me from joining him.

32:51.469 --> 32:52.762
Say that again.

32:55.723 --> 32:57.892
You would die for Mr. Jang?

33:01.062 --> 33:02.689
Is that what you just said?

33:03.731 --> 33:05.608
He's the first person to accept me.

33:06.651 --> 33:07.777
He said that

33:09.153 --> 33:10.363
it was okay to be myself.

33:12.740 --> 33:15.952
He helped me realize that I was human.

33:18.454 --> 33:19.956
So, for the first time…

33:22.834 --> 33:24.836
it wasn't painful to be alive.

33:25.920 --> 33:27.088
I also

33:28.506 --> 33:29.590
accepted you.

33:30.925 --> 33:34.262
You were born from a lowly courtesan,
but I accepted you as my son.

33:35.471 --> 33:38.224
I registered you under my family name
despite the objections.

33:40.059 --> 33:40.977
And yet

33:42.103 --> 33:43.396
you betray me?

33:45.440 --> 33:46.607
I'm sorry, Mother.

33:50.611 --> 33:51.738
Please let me go.

33:57.285 --> 33:58.369
Lift your head.

34:01.706 --> 34:02.874
Lift your head up.

34:04.250 --> 34:05.084
Now.

34:14.802 --> 34:19.223
The Najin inside you will fall deep asleep
for the next 24 hours.

34:24.729 --> 34:28.691
It will not protect you
under any circumstances whatsoever.

34:31.611 --> 34:34.572
A knife will make you bleed,
and the wound will not heal.

34:34.655 --> 34:38.201
A gunshot will penetrate your body
and lead to your death.

34:40.369 --> 34:42.497
You will not recover.

34:44.665 --> 34:47.543
Nor will you regenerate.

35:03.851 --> 35:05.478
You may go if you wish.

35:07.021 --> 35:08.689
I hope you go and learn

35:09.398 --> 35:12.735
how weak and agonizing the human body is

35:14.320 --> 35:16.781
and how meaningless
goodwill and righteousness are

35:17.949 --> 35:20.076
in the face of death.

35:24.956 --> 35:27.291
The choice is yours.

35:28.960 --> 35:30.461
I will leave the door open.

36:15.673 --> 36:18.843
The truth is,
I was there that day one year ago.

36:20.303 --> 36:23.431
But I couldn't jump in and help him.

36:28.978 --> 36:30.062
I was scared…

36:32.106 --> 36:33.191
that I might die.

36:37.737 --> 36:38.946
Being scared…

36:41.032 --> 36:42.617
isn't something to be sorry about.

36:45.870 --> 36:48.664
Some may be scared of dying…

36:54.045 --> 36:56.464
while others may be scared of living.

37:03.137 --> 37:05.973
The fears that people have
are all unique to themselves.

37:12.480 --> 37:16.234
And besides, Master Jang
never once questioned you about that.

37:20.112 --> 37:22.365
That means he already understands you.

37:26.118 --> 37:27.578
So don't be sorry.

38:09.495 --> 38:10.788
For the next 24 hours,

38:12.248 --> 38:13.582
your Najin will be asleep.

38:14.166 --> 38:17.253
During that time,
whether you're slashed with a knife

38:18.879 --> 38:20.339
or shot with a gun,

38:22.591 --> 38:23.426
you will die.

38:23.509 --> 38:26.387
But why…

38:27.680 --> 38:28.639
I told you.

38:30.808 --> 38:31.809
I was scared…

38:36.814 --> 38:37.898
that I might die.

39:17.897 --> 39:19.357
So we meet again.

39:19.440 --> 39:20.566
Yeah.

39:21.525 --> 39:22.443
Has it been a year?

39:23.027 --> 39:25.154
I'm sick and tired of your ass.

39:26.947 --> 39:29.075
Tenacity happens to be
my redeeming quality.

39:29.158 --> 39:31.827
You've reunited with the woman
you were yearning for.

39:31.911 --> 39:35.164
Why not stay by her side?
Why bother showing up again?

39:35.247 --> 39:36.248
Don't worry.

39:37.083 --> 39:39.710
Once I'm done here, I'll see myself out.

39:41.128 --> 39:42.755
Do you still trust Seung-jo?

40:09.657 --> 40:10.533
Yeah.

40:12.034 --> 40:12.868
I do.

40:15.955 --> 40:17.123
Poor girl.

40:21.335 --> 40:22.586
Just worry about yourself.

40:36.934 --> 40:40.479
They've lured Jang Tae-sang away,
and Seung-jo is with Yoon Chae-ok.

41:17.433 --> 41:18.267
Hey.

41:33.741 --> 41:34.575
By the way,

41:35.993 --> 41:41.373
if I go through with the surgery,
will I be able to play the cello again?

41:41.457 --> 41:42.541
Of course.

41:44.168 --> 41:46.670
You'll become a better cellist
than before the accident.

41:47.254 --> 41:49.882
When will I receive the transplant?

41:52.301 --> 41:55.095
I'm trying to select
the most suitable one for you.

41:55.846 --> 42:00.142
After three to six months,
the Najin learns most of the mechanisms.

42:00.726 --> 42:03.062
It should not bear a huge toll
on the new body.

42:03.604 --> 42:07.191
Is the success rate definitely higher
than when it's in its larval stage?

42:07.274 --> 42:08.943
The transplant of a mature Najin

42:10.653 --> 42:12.321
has not caused any deaths so far.

42:19.203 --> 42:20.538
We'll go with this one.

42:21.580 --> 42:23.415
Transplant it three months from now.

42:25.084 --> 42:26.752
Just wait three more months.

42:28.712 --> 42:30.339
You'll be able to walk again.

42:31.131 --> 42:31.966
Go on and eat.
